WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Groupie-Tracker: the home page lists the artists fetched from the API.

00:03.000 --> 00:15.000
Pink Floyd's page: members, first album, concert dates, and a map pinning each concert location.

00:15.000 --> 00:21.000
Back on the home page, scrolling through more artists.

00:21.000 --> 00:39.000
Red Hot Chili Peppers' page: the map spans concerts across several continents, then zooms in on the United States.

00:39.000 --> 00:44.133
The home page again, under its filters: creation date, first album date, number of members, concert location.
